  "title": "Lument Finance Trust Reports Second Quarter 2026 Results and Announces Reverse Stock Split",
  "summary": "NEW YORK, August 13, 2026 /PRNewswire/ — Lument Finance Trust, Inc. (NYSE: LFT) (“we”, “LFT” or “the Company”) today reported its second quarter results and also announced that its Board of Directors has unanimously approved a 1-for-10 reverse stock split of the Company’s issued and outstanding shares of common stock (the “Reverse Stock Split”). Second Quarter 2026 Results GAAP",
